"<p>SaaSBase is engineered with an efficient, monolithic control plane that communicates with managed VPS nodes via lightweight, secure protocols.</p>\n<h2>High-Level Topology</h2>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code class=\"language-mermaid\"><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">flowchart</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Panel</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">SaaSBase Control Panel </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Host / VPS</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    direction</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LR</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    UI</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Web UI (Mantine 9 + TanStack Router)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Nitro</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Nitro Server (React 19, Bun)&#x3C;br/>• Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL&#x3C;br/>• Job Queue &#x26; Cron Scheduler&#x3C;br/>• WebSocket xterm.js Web PTY\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  Panel </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-->|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SSH2 / ed25519</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Remote</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Remote VPS Node\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  Panel </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-->|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">nsenter / Docker socket</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Localhost (Self-Host Node)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Remote</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Remote VPS Node\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    direction TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Traefik v3 (Reverse Proxy + ACME SSL)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Supabase</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Supabase Stack&#x3C;br/>(PostgreSQL Vector, GoTrue, Studio)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TR </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> Appwrite</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Appwrite / Other Apps\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  subgraph</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">Localhost </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Self</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Host Node</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">)</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    direction TB</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Traefik v3 (Reverse Proxy + ACME SSL)\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> App</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SaaSBase App Container\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    TL </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">--></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> DB</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">[</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PostgreSQL 16 Engine\"</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  end</span></span></code></pre>\n<h2>Key Architectural Principles</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>In-Process Single-Instance Core:</strong> Background jobs, cron schedulers, and server locking mechanisms execute directly in-process for predictable memory consumption and instant synchronization.</li>\n<li><strong>Stateless Node Management:</strong> Remote nodes run standard Docker and Traefik containers. SaaSBase leaves no heavy monitoring agents or resident daemons on your target servers.</li>\n<li><strong>End-to-End Type Safety:</strong> Fully unified TypeScript codebase leveraging Drizzle ORM, Zod validation schemas, and TanStack React Start.</li>\n</ol>"